        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FlockingWars is a fast-paced real-time strategy game where you command armies of flocking creatures. Take control of birds, fish, mammals, and insects in short, intense battles for control of the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Campaign mode where you conquer a continent in turn-based strategic warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Eight playable species: Seagulls, Bison, Dolphins, Wolves, Bees, Hawks, Penguins, and Locusts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Thousands of units moving using flocking-style behaviour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic gameplay with 32 nodes to control, terrain advantages, and structures such as Nests, Dens, and Hives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large-scale battles handled smoothly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Species Guide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seagulls: Fast scouts that excel over water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bison: Heavy frontline units with very high health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dolphins: Dominant in water but unable to fight on land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wolves: Strong in forests and reliable all-round fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bees: Swarm units that rely on overwhelming numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hawks: Elite predators that control the mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Penguins: Defensive specialists for frozen terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Locusts: Fast raiders that thrive in the desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your chosen species to dominate an entire continent. Plan your moves on a strategic map of 21 territories, earn campaign points to improve defences and launch new attacks, and continue your invasion with automatically saved progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse: Left-click and drag to select units, right-click and drag to move them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FlockingWars is a fast-paced real-time strategy game where you command armies of flocking creatures. Take control of birds, fish, mammals, and insects in short, intense battles for control of the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Campaign mode where you conquer a continent in turn-based strategic warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Eight playable species: Seagulls, Bison, Dolphins, Wolves, Bees, Hawks, Penguins, and Locusts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Thousands of units moving using flocking-style behaviour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic gameplay with 32 nodes to control, terrain advantages, and structures such as Nests, Dens, and Hives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large-scale battles handled smoothly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Species Guide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seagulls: Fast scouts that excel over water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bison: Heavy frontline units with very high health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dolphins: Dominant in water but unable to fight on land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wolves: Strong in forests and reliable all-round fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bees: Swarm units that rely on overwhelming numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hawks: Elite predators that control the mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Penguins: Defensive specialists for frozen terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Locusts: Fast raiders that thrive in the desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your chosen species to dominate an entire continent. Plan your moves on a strategic map of 21 territories, earn campaign points to improve defences and launch new attacks, and continue your invasion with automatically saved progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse: Left-click and drag to select units, right-click and drag to move them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
